{"4227750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Robertinho Adventures", "steam_appid": 4227750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227750/extras/3d0b7266303e2969e8ea59e3190c37cc.avif?t=1781909558\" alt=\"\"width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robertinho Adventures is a 2D action platform game where you play as Robertinho, a young boy who seeks to save his dog, Caramelito, from a great villain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the cities of Braçal with your coins, face infiltrated aliens and save his great partner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227750/extras/2a9c20993f3a5614686b1042d0d8f756.avif?t=1781909558\" alt=\"\"width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Face more than 40 different aliens armed with your boomerang cap!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Find 4 soccer balls to kick like explosive and magical soccer balls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Travel across all of Brasal in over 15 levels, going from the metropolis of São Pedro to even facing a dense forest in Amadonas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Find coins or steal them from your enemies! With the money you can pay for a bus ticket to travel through the cities and save your dog!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Discover the Robertinho's mysterious past!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• We have dogs, do you need anything else?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227750/extras/46d18ea9031a29912023e7d5668e8ecc.poster.avif?t=1781909558\" aria-label=\"Brazilian bus stopping to let Robertinho off at the bus stop!\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227750/extras/46d18ea9031a29912023e7d5668e8ecc.webm?t=1781909558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227750/extras/46d18ea9031a29912023e7d5668e8ecc.mp4?t=1781909558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227750/extras/216f80c3cb5ce0e26be722fcf769e452.poster.avif?t=1781909558\" aria-label=\"Robertinho walking through a dense and dark forest, attacking a golden monkey with his boomerang cap!\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227750/extras/216f80c3cb5ce0e26be722fcf769e452.webm?t=1781909558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227750/extras/216f80c3cb5ce0e26be722fcf769e452.mp4?t=1781909558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227750/extras/94e5e109beaed5d632c48e936977d3d1.poster.avif?t=1781909558\" aria-label=\"Robertinho sliding on sand, with a shiny sea in background, reaching the sea and finding an Alien Crab!\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227750/extras/94e5e109beaed5d632c48e936977d3d1.webm?t=1781909558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227750/extras/94e5e109beaed5d632c48e936977d3d1.mp4?t=1781909558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227750/extras/3d0b7266303e2969e8ea59e3190c37cc.avif?t=1781909558\" alt=\"\"width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robertinho Adventures is a 2D action platform game where you play as Robertinho, a young boy who seeks to save his dog, Caramelito, from a great villain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the cities of Braçal with your coins, face infiltrated aliens and save his great partner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227750/extras/2a9c20993f3a5614686b1042d0d8f756.avif?t=1781909558\" alt=\"\"width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Face more than 40 different aliens armed with your boomerang cap!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Find 4 soccer balls to kick like explosive and magical soccer balls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Travel across all of Brasal in over 15 levels, going from the metropolis of São Pedro to even facing a dense forest in Amadonas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Find coins or steal them from your enemies! With the money you can pay for a bus ticket to travel through the cities and save your dog!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Discover the Robertinho's mysterious past!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• We have dogs, do you need anything else?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227750/extras/46d18ea9